{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can add advanced and convenient features to TyranoStudio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Chat Novel Maker</strong><br>Allows you to intuitively create games in a chat-style visual novel format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Text Converter</strong><br>A tool that converts scenario files into script format based on defined rules.<br>Enables automation of script creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Character Variation Maker</strong><br>Visually manage and register character variations, which often become complex.<br>Automatically generates the necessary tags as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, the following premium plugins will become available for download:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule Transition Mask Plugin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule Transition Background Change Plugin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 Rule Image Materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QTE (Quick Time Event) Plugin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More advanced features will be added as a priority in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605How to Use\u2605</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you purchase the DLC, TyranoStudio will be automatically updated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the changes are not reflected, please try restarting the application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For paid plugins,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">select the desired DLC from the &quot;DLC&quot; section in the left menu and download it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774460?t=1748600912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774460?t=1748600912","capsule_image"